converter emits an inverted-crouch alias absent from its own package;
rejecting that resource prevented otherwise valid classic imports.
Preserve the emitted alias and native completion behavior. Keep errors
for malformed resources, missing aliases, cycles, and invalid states.

Bind classic player item queries to remaining use ticks, equipped and
rendered hand snapshots, and per-hand charge state. Independent execution
