Declare the 70 reachable binary layouts in Java, preserving field order,
optional values, tagged variants, and hashed component identities.

Compare all 115 definitions through the licensed loader with the MIT
brarchive-extractor reference at revision
503a8ce7ad94030241a3590c926ac36f72169c71. Preserve its license notice.
Reject unsupported format versions, duplicate or unknown components,
