separate smaller limits for bone expressions and execution complexity.

Extend Molang math with inverse_lerp and all 30 easing functions verified
against Bedrock 1.26.51.1's descriptor table and constant-fold dispatcher.
Preserve float operands, extrapolation, exponential endpoint offsets and
