weight totals before resource resolution. This resource step does not establish
animation dispatch, audible output, captions, or completed effect parity.

Resolve the licensed catalog's OGG samples as well as FSB banks. Search each
pack's formats before lower packs so an OGG replacement can override FSB.
The target 1.26.51.1 extension initializer declares FSB, OGG, then WAV;
Microsoft documents replacements across those formats. The shared core decoder
now supplies WAV samples through the same playback path.

Use Minecraft's JOrbis decoder after checking container bounds, stream
