Independent native execution supplies 646 cases. Production matches every
position, direction and ordered random call exactly as float32. Random and
entity bounds accessors are supplied boundaries. Thread the actor's current
bounds through timeline/controller requests and each world emission.
Native local-space transforms and visible parity remain separate work.

Native initial-speed function 1461c2690 normalizes the sampled direction
before applying scalar speed. Scalar Molang expressions evaluate separately
