write. Other palette callers and free pieces without usable receipt
keys still need separate work.

Resolve color assets before the final profile hash check so a slow licensed
package acquisition cannot leave the save based on an old account recipe.
The save retains the native request shape and exact readback check.

Create the first tint group for an equipped piece without saved colors.
Bedrock 1.26.51.1 picker 14713b490 reaches editor 1486238a0 and
