pack. Transaction IDs are opaque strings. All saved appearances remain
unchanged. Paid transactions, full asynchronous UI acquisition, Xbox Store
redemption, and accounts without receipt keys remain unverified. Captures,
credentials, receipts, assets and probe code stay private.

Synchronize Microsoft Store purchases through transaction/redeem/xbox
before refreshing persona and owned classic catalogs. Use the selected
account's PlayFab-scoped Xbox XSTS token and XUID. The general Xbox Live
token receives HTTP 401; the PlayFab audience is documented by Microsoft's
Store redemption API and accepted by the native Minecraft endpoint.
Validate successful, failed and transaction lists, preserve partial results,
and read the fresh inventory receipt after synchronization. Catalog loading
continues on synchronization failure. Retain visible recipes and pack rows;
disable dependent writes during refresh and discard results after account
or screen changes.

Native Bedrock 1.26.51.1 captures establish MarketplaceData.userId and
xboxAuthentication.XboxToken in the Redemption request. A live production
