verification, paid acquisition and receipt-less accounts remain separate
work. Raw captures, tokens and probes stay private.

Support linear, Bezier, Catmull-Rom and Bezier-chain particle curves at
render time before particle render expressions. Keep curve variables
particle-local, evaluate dynamic nodes in native order, and preserve
