resolution, expression callbacks and variable access are supplied boundaries.
Rework the 192 matrix comparisons to exercise the production offset adapter
and add a child/grandchild placement regression. Scheduling and native
visible comparisons remain separate work.

Distinguish live actor objects from retained registry components in particle
attachments. The target registry path interpolates position and wrapped yaw,
uses registry locators, and ignores the actor binding offset in its position
