boundary and invalidate replacement identities.

Registry-only bound children retain parent construction origin and binding
metadata, while invalid actor contexts suppress child initialization and
local-position rendering. Expire before the first update but preserve its
native births; clear local populations on subsequent invalid updates and
allow world-space particles to drain. Keep binding presence separate from
