The first creation expression has no emitter owner in its query context.
Install zero count bindings for that expression, then retain live bindings
through child initialization, updates, loop restarts and particle copies.
Aggregate matching definition identifiers across resource libraries and
clear all counters when playback stops.

Independent execution verifies 84 prepared scalar cases with 672 callback
calls, four manager frames with 36 count receipts, and two restart context
cases. Native count readers, manager pruning and publication, and restart
component dispatch execute. Platform access, map allocation, factory
registration, emitter updates, expression callbacks and random variable
registration are supplied or skipped boundaries. Production tests compare
count publication and Molang lifecycle behavior. Full constructor execution,
client frame gates, complete query context and visible playback remain
unverified; these checks do not establish full particle or skin parity.

Bedrock 1.26.51.1 registers spellcolor through functor 14e7ff500 and
callback 14220f9d0. Read actor metadata slot 77 only when its type is Int
(2). Return RGBA structure fields as float32 byte channels divided by 255;
