Independent native execution verifies 1504 scalar cases, all 256 byte
values in each channel, and 60 prepared initialization/context cases.
Actor and metadata gates and float32 conversion execute. Metadata type,
color structure allocation/cleanup, actor/resource lookup and expression
callbacks are supplied. Production tests execute actual Molang and tint
render inputs, snapshots, actor removal and replacement. Live network
