The target 1.26.51.1 native Bases request exposes the equipped Brawny Skin
as price zero with requiresRedeem, without a pack-specific receipt key.
Its published PersonaDurable identity matches and the production decoder
reads its body and face tint maps using existing account receipt keys.
Treat zero-price asset eligibility separately from redemption permission
to equip; keep published price, content type, product and pack checks.
Require receipt keys and never redeem or spend currency while preparing
an already saved recipe. Parameterize the identity guards across both
