Missing or expired credentials return an explicit sign-in requirement.

Consume bounded private helper output before reporting an early process
exit, so loader errors do not become misleading closed-stdin failures.
Keep payloads and credentials out of diagnostics, and package both helper
variants with independent checksums for local builds and release CI.

Expose Default for arms and legs without requiring users to find each
